comment0.text=\r\n\ Question\ 4(a)\r\nThis\ class\ creates\ load\ balancer\ objects,\ \r\nto\ store\ and\ help\ manager\ a\ number\ of\ virtual\r\nmachines\ in\ a\ theoretical\ small\ private\ network\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Ryan\ Le\ Roux\r\n\ @version\ 1.0\r\n
